{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879786",
      "title": "Organizing your Store with Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 223,
      "videoOrder": 196,
      "sourceHash": "95b2ef2880d8b3ffc820d988b09907f6bb676d819db89a84b273014697363a33",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 5.66,
          "en": "A pretty nice feature provided by Vuex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.66,
          "end": 8.98,
          "en": "as your store and your state and zone grows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.98,
          "end": 13.66,
          "en": "is the possibility to set up modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.66,
          "end": 17.023,
          "en": "To split your store into multiple modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 21.55,
          "en": "You may only have one store per application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.55,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "but this store can be made up of multiple modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.3,
          "en": "To keep your code more manageable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.3,
          "end": 32.24,
          "en": "You automatically, if you don't set up any modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.24,
          "end": 34.69,
          "en": "have one module, you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.69,
          "end": 37.21,
          "en": "the root module, the root state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.21,
          "end": 41.33,
          "en": "but you can then add as many other modules as you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.33,
          "end": 44.1,
          "en": "For example one module for the counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 47.9,
          "en": "and another module for authentication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.9,
          "end": 51.43,
          "en": "Or you leave authentication in the root state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.43,
          "end": 54.52,
          "en": "in the root module and outsource the counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.52,
          "end": 56.41,
          "en": "into an extra module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.41,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "That would also be possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 60.03,
          "en": "And that's what we're going to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.88,
          "end": 62.65,
          "en": "So here in main.js still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.65,
          "end": 65.07,
          "en": "I'm going to create a new counterModule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.41,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "which is an object, not a store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "just a regular JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 77.84,
          "en": "But now it's an object with exactly the same features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.84,
          "end": 80.98,
          "en": "as the object you pass to create store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.98,
          "end": 83.73,
          "en": "So it may have a state method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.73,
          "end": 86.72,
          "en": "It may have mutations, which is an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.72,
          "end": 90.61,
          "en": "It may have actions, which is an object and getters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.61,
          "end": 92.593,
          "en": "So exactly the same features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.6,
          "end": 97.343,
          "en": "And in state, we of course also return an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.62,
          "end": 102.08,
          "en": "But now we can move our counter state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.08,
          "end": 106.06,
          "en": "out of this global store, into this counterModule.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.38,
          "end": 110.71000000000001,
          "en": "The same for the mutations related to our counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.71000000000001,
          "end": 114.65299999999999,
          "en": "grab them and moved them here into mutations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.5,
          "end": 118.35,
          "en": "The same for the actions of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.35,
          "end": 121.22,
          "en": "grab the counter related actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.22,
          "end": 123.43,
          "en": "remove them from our global store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.43,
          "end": 125.063,
          "en": "and add them to actions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.09,
          "end": 130.19,
          "en": "And you guessed it the same for our getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.19,
          "end": 131.93,
          "en": "grab the counter getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.93,
          "end": 133.853,
          "en": "remove them from the global store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 136.663,
          "en": "and add them to getters here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.32999999999998,
          "end": 143.32999999999998,
          "en": "With that, our global store, our main store, is way leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.64,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "It now has only the Authlogic left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 151.36,
          "en": "And we could put this logic into a separate module as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.36,
          "end": 152.363,
          "en": "if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.05,
          "end": 157.853,
          "en": "But how do we now get the module back into the store?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.87,
          "end": 161.86,
          "en": "Well, createStore, this object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.86,
          "end": 166,
          "en": "also takes a modules option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166,
          "end": 168.97,
          "en": "And modules is an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.97,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "And here you now add all the modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 174.603,
          "en": "you wanna merge together into one store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 179.8,
          "en": "You give every module an identifier of your choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.8,
          "end": 184.76,
          "en": "for example, counter or numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.76,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "or whatever the name should be, this is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 189.19,
          "en": "Here I'll go with numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.24,
          "end": 194,
          "en": "and then point at the module object that should be merged.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194,
          "end": 196.163,
          "en": "In this case, the counter module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.21,
          "end": 200.043,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.05,
          "end": 204.053,
          "en": "And now this will be merged into this store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.12,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "If you save this now, everything will work as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 210.72,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "because by default, modules merged into a store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.23,
          "end": 218.57999999999998,
          "en": "are all merged on the same level, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.57999999999998,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "So if you merge a module into this store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 223.82999999999998,
          "en": "it is as if you would have to find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.82999999999998,
          "end": 225.41,
          "en": "all the getters and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.41,
          "end": 226.96,
          "en": "directly in the store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.96,
          "end": 229.303,
          "en": "as we had it before a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.24,
          "end": 232.61,
          "en": "That's why we can still dispatch all the actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.61,
          "end": 235.21,
          "en": "and use all the getters as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.21,
          "end": 238.3,
          "en": "even though we're now using a module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.3,
          "end": 239.133,
          "en": "And as mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.133,
          "end": 242.83,
          "en": "you can of course have as many modules as you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.83,
          "end": 246.18,
          "en": "But the idea of modules doesn't end here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.18,
          "end": 248.063,
          "en": "there's more we can do with that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
